cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this dataset and the original studies supplying the values used in your analysis."
type: dataset
title: "Spin and Thermal Constraints for 144 Rapidly Rotating Neutron Stars"
authors:
  - family-names: Wu
    given-names: Zeyue
  - family-names: Chen
    given-names: Zhiwei
version: 1.0.0
url: "https://github.com/EisblumeKs/catalogue_sources_neutron_star"
abstract: >-
  Spin frequencies and thermal constraints for 144 rapidly rotating neutron
  stars, comprising 18 accreting transients and 126 rotation-powered
  millisecond pulsars. The catalogue contains eight two-sided thermal
  estimates and 136 temperature ceilings, with reference core-temperature
  coordinates, source-level references, and field definitions.
keywords:
  - neutron stars
  - millisecond pulsars
  - r-modes
  - thermal emission
  - stellar catalogues
